   <section id="about" className="about"><div className="pixel-portrait" aria-hidden="true"/><h2>Eleven people.<br/>One shop in Leeds.<br/>Four factories.<br/><em>Never any sales.</em></h2><div>{ABOUT.map(x=><p key={x}>{x}</p>)}</div></section>
  </main><footer className="footer"><strong>MARLOW &amp; VALE</strong><p>A smaller wardrobe.<br/>A brighter tomorrow.</p><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></footer>
